Changes from the behavioral reference:
- Standalone ES-module plugin; no Operit terminal, Compose DSL, Linux or Node runtime.
- Role-separated data by default; explicit shared-phone mode with guarded mode changes.
- Independent responsive UI and symbols; 21 modules / 42 collections / 31 tool names.
- Strict structured role tasks through opaque ai.generate, five actions per transaction.
- Foreground chat surface uses confirmed host chat read/append and up to six AI rounds.
  Durable intent/receipt journals avoid automatically replaying uncertain side effects.
- Specialized calendar, map, media, social, recipe, shopping and ledger interfaces.
- Plugin-specific secure credentials and host-proxied networking only.
- Explicit loopback HTTP music backends use network.local; image services stay HTTPS.
- Portable schema-1 records and optional image backup; explicit corruption recovery.
